sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant A as Org A · Buyer (LangGraph, A2A client)
    participant W as A2A (HTTP wire)
    participant V as Org B · Verifier (AgentOAuth)
    participant C as Org B · CrewAI + private inventory

    A->>A: build Action (order.place, amount ≤ limits)
    A->>A: issue + sign Consent Token  🔏 Signature 1 (agent key)
    A->>W: A2A Task "place_order"  { token, buyer public key }
    W->>V: deliver task

    Note over V: VERIFY BEFORE ACTING
    V->>V: check agent signature (Sig 1) ✓
    V->>V: compute private quote
    V->>V: evaluate policy(action, quote vs limit) → verdict

    alt verdict = DENY (price violation)
        V->>V: sign DENY receipt  🔏 Signature 2
        V-->>W: artifact { receipt, verifier public key } · state = rejected
    else verdict = ALLOW
        V->>C: ask CrewAI to fulfil (reason over private inventory)
        alt in stock
            C-->>V: fulfilled (order placed, executed = true)
        else out of stock / timeout
            C-->>V: fulfilment_failed (executed = false)
        end
        V->>V: sign Consent Receipt  🔏 Signature 2 (verifier key)
        V-->>W: artifact { receipt, verifier public key } · state = completed / failed
    end

    W-->>A: deliver result
    A->>A: verify receipt (Sig 2) offline vs verifier public key ✓
    A->>A: check binding: sha256(token) == receipt.consent_token_hash ✓
